<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Interview Rules</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #222;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        ol {
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        strong {
            color: #111;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Interview Rules</h1>

        <ol>
            <li>
                <strong>Camera On:</strong>
                Candidates must keep their camera on during the interview.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Screen Sharing:</strong>
                Be ready to share your screen if required.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Preparation:</strong>
                Candidates should be well-prepared based on the information they provided
                in the form and their portfolio. However, questions may extend beyond the
                submitted details.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Coding Assessment:</strong>
                You may be asked to write or debug code during the interview, so it is
                strongly advised to join via a laptop or desktop.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Professionalism:</strong>
                Maintain a professional demeanor throughout the interview. The preferred
                spoken language is English.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Punctuality:</strong>
                Respect everyone's time by joining the meeting on time. The interview
                duration can range from 15 minutes to 1 hour.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Rule:</strong>
                Follow all instructions provided by the interviewers during the interview.
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
